     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1049156">VEX.128.F2.0F38.W0 50 /r</para>
      <para unique="1049157">VPDPBSSD xmm1, xmm2, xmm3/m128</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1049161">A</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1049163">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1049165">AVX_VNNI_INT8</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1049167">Multiply groups of 4 pairs of signed bytes in xmm3/m128 with corresponding signed bytes of xmm2, summing those products and adding them to the doubleword result in xmm1.</para>
